      "summary": {
        "text": "Connor Greene Hall (born February 17, 1997) is an American professional stock car racing driver. He last competed part-time in the NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series, driving the No. 4 Chevrolet Silverado RST for Niece Motorsports, and part-time in the ARCA Menards Series East, driving the No. 24 Chevrolet for SPS Racing. He has previously competed in the NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series, ARCA Menards Series, and the ARCA Menards Series West. Hall is the 2023 and 2024 NASCAR Advance Auto Parts Weekly Series National champion.",
